From 5b018f85c7444e5808832987187db36db78ea574 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ben Walker <ben@nvidia.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Aug 2024 10:40:12 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 04/21] sock: Move impl_name into spdk_sock_opts

Since we're breaking the API, let's move this typically unused option
into the spdk_sock_opts struct.

Change-Id: Ibb8a5d9742a90466fd578cdf641d745ffb633c5e
Signed-off-by: Ben Walker <ben@nvidia.com>
